WEBVTT

00:06:57.955 --> 00:07:01.375
about the harm that they wished upon Sarah

00:07:01.417 --> 00:07:03.461
and her husband

00:07:03.461 --> 00:07:05.004
and their children.

00:07:05.671 --> 00:07:10.050
And still, Sarah never backed down
from telling the truth

00:07:10.092 --> 00:07:12.386
about the process that she led.

00:07:13.888 --> 00:07:18.267
In that moment, I was so overwhelmed
with gratitude and love

00:07:18.309 --> 00:07:21.812
and admiration for Sarah
that I couldn't help the tears.

00:07:23.314 --> 00:07:25.566
But I think if I'm being
super, super honest,

00:07:25.608 --> 00:07:30.571
I was just so happy
that my friend was still here to hug.